{
  "_comment": "CountingApp (kids shell) screenshot capture: 11 distinct activity states (tap-to-count scenes, How many?, the hundred chart, a skip-counting song, number tracing, Make the number, What comes next?), each a different number or round seed and a cycled theme (lagoon / sand / night). No home menu, sticker book, parent area, gate or reveal popup in any slot. _setup_taps unlocks full_pack (so counting to 100, all songs and games are reachable and no banner), mutes the voice for capture, and seeds a few stickers. Screens are opened with KIDS.go(screen, params); trace prog {s: finished strokes, f: fraction of the next} shows a stroke mid-trace; play seed fixes the round.",
